    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Remain</i>\u00a0is a game\u00a0with multiple survival\u00a0elements. You will have to\u00a0fight against zombies and mutated creatures. Also, you should always stay\u00a0vigilant about\u00a0other survivors, as they may\u00a0raid\u00a0your supplies or\u00a0even take\u00a0your life. Yet the light of hope is not extinguished, as if the dawn is waiting in the end even for the longest night! In this\u00a0doomsday, some warriors are regaining hope\u00a0by\u00a0utilizing technological devices to tame\u00a0&quot;zombies&quot; for rebuilding or protection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game currently has an 80 square kilometer\u00a0explorable area, which is merely a portion of the ultimate design. The total area of the map is\u00a0planned to cover\u00a0256 square kilometers, and it shall be\u00a0completed\u00a0in subsequent updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Remain</i>\u00a0has independent game servers that\u00a0are\u00a0maintained by our game studio. Players can create their own lobbies\u00a0on the server. The PVE mode supports 4 - 16 people, and the PVP mode supports 30 - 100 people. Server sessions\u00a0are spread\u00a0across Europe, America, and Asia, allowing players to experience the game in a low-lag\u00a0environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PVE Survival and Combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can search for supplies, collect blueprints of various high-tech\u00a0devices, face harsh survival environments or potentially hostile creatures, and improve their\u00a0combat capabilities\u00a0by surviving and exploring the open world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In each\u00a0cycle, a large number of AI will gather. It will be very difficult to completely defeat them. They are aiming to\u00a0destroy your buildings and attack you. Some AI has\u00a0special features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thieves: Steal your vegetables, crops, and your\u00a0poultry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Medical Teams: Some AI will help injured AIs\u00a0to recover. You should first consider targeting\u00a0this type of foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summoning Teams: They may summon a larger number of AI in a short time, making\u00a0your defense more challenging...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227110/extras/b72ec1d44f3431918448f499f5bb3d87.poster.avif?t=1755591807\" width=640 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227110/extras/b72ec1d44f3431918448f499f5bb3d87.webm?t=1755591807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227110/extras/b72ec1d44f3431918448f499f5bb3d87.mp4?t=1755591807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227110/extras/37703ca8ac23b5d883362ceb1c9fbc90.poster.avif?t=1755591807\" width=640 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227110/extras/37703ca8ac23b5d883362ceb1c9fbc90.webm?t=1755591807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227110/extras/37703ca8ac23b5d883362ceb1c9fbc90.mp4?t=1755591807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PVP Raiding\u00a0and Combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the PVP mode, players can\u00a0form teams to build their community bases, and there will be confrontation, raiding, slaughter, and betrayal between teams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227110/extras/c71e7e1de8b707bcabc8adee82105279.poster.avif?t=1755591807\" width=640 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227110/extras/c71e7e1de8b707bcabc8adee82105279.webm?t=1755591807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227110/extras/c71e7e1de8b707bcabc8adee82105279.mp4?t=1755591807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Capturing Zombies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can learn various survival skills in the game, such as building skills, craft\u00a0skills, advanced technology, or even building\u00a0controller\u00a0devices\u00a0to capture zombies. The tamed zombies will help you fight against enemies or work for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227110/extras/d8ebe3d5ac50bf56d3c7ada60179a478.poster.avif?t=1755591807\" width=640 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227110/extras/d8ebe3d5ac50bf56d3c7ada60179a478.webm?t=1755591807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227110/extras/d8ebe3d5ac50bf56d3c7ada60179a478.mp4?t=1755591807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Building Bases</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can build your survival fortress based on\u00a0your ideas to resist zombies and other survivors. Or you can design it purely for art to show your building talent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227110/extras/5e8c4995bdd1b286a275efb34a8541e3.poster.avif?t=1755591807\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227110/extras/5e8c4995bdd1b286a275efb34a8541e3.webm?t=1755591807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227110/extras/5e8c4995bdd1b286a275efb34a8541e3.mp4?t=1755591807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Agriculture</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can farm within the scope of your territory. You can build an\u00a0irrigation system\u00a0which\u00a0will greatly save your\u00a0time and promote the growth speed of crops. You can command\u00a0the tamed zombies to operate in agriculture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227110/extras/3cd41244cfadbf29d2e483fde6ae08ac.poster.avif?t=1755591807\" width=640 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227110/extras/3cd41244cfadbf29d2e483fde6ae08ac.webm?t=1755591807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227110/extras/3cd41244cfadbf29d2e483fde6ae08ac.mp4?t=1755591807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Power System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game provides a highly free power system. You can use electricity\u00a0supply devices to power up\u00a0large-scale\u00a0electric\u00a0facilities. The supply devices\u00a0Include\u00a0generators, solar panels, and wind turbines. These will all be sources of your power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227110/extras/44983d31abaa3f8fc074c5277f98396c.poster.avif?t=1755591807\" width=640 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227110/extras/44983d31abaa3f8fc074c5277f98396c.webm?t=1755591807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227110/extras/44983d31abaa3f8fc074c5277f98396c.mp4?t=1755591807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hunting</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can hunt in the game. The trophies\u00a0of your prey\u00a0can be traded and sold in\u00a0farms or other\u00a0places\u00a0for trade, which\u00a0enables\u00a0you to gather\u00a0your food\u00a0supplies quickly. Some survival supplies can be directly purchased in the store.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227110/extras/f0241862d2ee72f96d10f345bec93622.poster.avif?t=1755591807\" width=640 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227110/extras/f0241862d2ee72f96d10f345bec93622.webm?t=1755591807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227110/extras/f0241862d2ee72f96d10f345bec93622.mp4?t=1755591807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227110/extras/eb242e7b6eb81fa2bc7b56bc26d9cb1c.poster.avif?t=1755591807\" width=640 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227110/extras/eb242e7b6eb81fa2bc7b56bc26d9cb1c.webm?t=1755591807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227110/extras/eb242e7b6eb81fa2bc7b56bc26d9cb1c.mp4?t=1755591807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vehicles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can obtain vehicles through scavenging and trading, but it is very difficult for you to own\u00a0a complete vehicle. Usually, they will lack some parts and you have to repair and reassemble them to have a functional vehicle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227110/extras/71ddb660f497132b721e6bb6e3ee1a37.poster.avif?t=1755591807\" width=640 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227110/extras/71ddb660f497132b721e6bb6e3ee1a37.webm?t=1755591807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227110/extras/71ddb660f497132b721e6bb6e3ee1a37.mp4?t=1755591807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227110/extras/9e42b048eee0a19f6415a8ed38249a26.poster.avif?t=1755591807\" width=640 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227110/extras/9e42b048eee0a19f6415a8ed38249a26.webm?t=1755591807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227110/extras/9e42b048eee0a19f6415a8ed38249a26.mp4?t=1755591807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trading</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you can trade in the trading area, using items obtained through scavenging and combat to trade for\u00a0your survival necessities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227110/extras/149b1d3298282d3bf9756d107734e9c0.poster.avif?t=1755591807\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227110/extras/149b1d3298282d3bf9756d107734e9c0.webm?t=1755591807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227110/extras/149b1d3298282d3bf9756d107734e9c0.mp4?t=1755591807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Remain</i>\u00a0is a game\u00a0with multiple survival\u00a0elements. You will have to\u00a0fight against zombies and mutated creatures. Also, you should always stay\u00a0vigilant about\u00a0other survivors, as they may\u00a0raid\u00a0your supplies or\u00a0even take\u00a0your life. Yet the light of hope is not extinguished, as if the dawn is waiting in the end even for the longest night! In this\u00a0doomsday, some warriors are regaining hope\u00a0by\u00a0utilizing technological devices to tame\u00a0&quot;zombies&quot; for rebuilding or protection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game currently has an 80 square kilometer\u00a0explorable area, which is merely a portion of the ultimate design. The total area of the map is\u00a0planned to cover\u00a0256 square kilometers, and it shall be\u00a0completed\u00a0in subsequent updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Remain</i>\u00a0has independent game servers that\u00a0are\u00a0maintained by our game studio. Players can create their own lobbies\u00a0on the server. The PVE mode supports 4 - 16 people, and the PVP mode supports 30 - 100 people. Server sessions\u00a0are spread\u00a0across Europe, America, and Asia, allowing players to experience the game in a low-lag\u00a0environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PVE Survival and Combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can search for supplies, collect blueprints of various high-tech\u00a0devices, face harsh survival environments or potentially hostile creatures, and improve their\u00a0combat capabilities\u00a0by surviving and exploring the open world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In each\u00a0cycle, a large number of AI will gather. It will be very difficult to completely defeat them. They are aiming to\u00a0destroy your buildings and attack you. Some AI has\u00a0special features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thieves: Steal your vegetables, crops, and your\u00a0poultry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Medical Teams: Some AI will help injured AIs\u00a0to recover. You should first consider targeting\u00a0this type of foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summoning Teams: They may summon a larger number of AI in a short time, making\u00a0your defense more challenging...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227110/extras/b72ec1d44f3431918448f499f5bb3d87.poster.avif?t=1755591807\" width=640 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227110/extras/b72ec1d44f3431918448f499f5bb3d87.webm?t=1755591807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227110/extras/b72ec1d44f3431918448f499f5bb3d87.mp4?t=1755591807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227110/extras/37703ca8ac23b5d883362ceb1c9fbc90.poster.avif?t=1755591807\" width=640 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227110/extras/37703ca8ac23b5d883362ceb1c9fbc90.webm?t=1755591807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227110/extras/37703ca8ac23b5d883362ceb1c9fbc90.mp4?t=1755591807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PVP Raiding\u00a0and Combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the PVP mode, players can\u00a0form teams to build their community bases, and there will be confrontation, raiding, slaughter, and betrayal between teams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227110/extras/c71e7e1de8b707bcabc8adee82105279.poster.avif?t=1755591807\" width=640 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227110/extras/c71e7e1de8b707bcabc8adee82105279.webm?t=1755591807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227110/extras/c71e7e1de8b707bcabc8adee82105279.mp4?t=1755591807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Capturing Zombies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can learn various survival skills in the game, such as building skills, craft\u00a0skills, advanced technology, or even building\u00a0controller\u00a0devices\u00a0to capture zombies. The tamed zombies will help you fight against enemies or work for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227110/extras/d8ebe3d5ac50bf56d3c7ada60179a478.poster.avif?t=1755591807\" width=640 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227110/extras/d8ebe3d5ac50bf56d3c7ada60179a478.webm?t=1755591807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227110/extras/d8ebe3d5ac50bf56d3c7ada60179a478.mp4?t=1755591807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Building Bases</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can build your survival fortress based on\u00a0your ideas to resist zombies and other survivors. Or you can design it purely for art to show your building talent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227110/extras/5e8c4995bdd1b286a275efb34a8541e3.poster.avif?t=1755591807\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227110/extras/5e8c4995bdd1b286a275efb34a8541e3.webm?t=1755591807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227110/extras/5e8c4995bdd1b286a275efb34a8541e3.mp4?t=1755591807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Agriculture</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can farm within the scope of your territory. You can build an\u00a0irrigation system\u00a0which\u00a0will greatly save your\u00a0time and promote the growth speed of crops. You can command\u00a0the tamed zombies to operate in agriculture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227110/extras/3cd41244cfadbf29d2e483fde6ae08ac.poster.avif?t=1755591807\" width=640 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227110/extras/3cd41244cfadbf29d2e483fde6ae08ac.webm?t=1755591807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227110/extras/3cd41244cfadbf29d2e483fde6ae08ac.mp4?t=1755591807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Power System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game provides a highly free power system. You can use electricity\u00a0supply devices to power up\u00a0large-scale\u00a0electric\u00a0facilities. The supply devices\u00a0Include\u00a0generators, solar panels, and wind turbines. These will all be sources of your power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227110/extras/44983d31abaa3f8fc074c5277f98396c.poster.avif?t=1755591807\" width=640 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227110/extras/44983d31abaa3f8fc074c5277f98396c.webm?t=1755591807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227110/extras/44983d31abaa3f8fc074c5277f98396c.mp4?t=1755591807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hunting</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can hunt in the game. The trophies\u00a0of your prey\u00a0can be traded and sold in\u00a0farms or other\u00a0places\u00a0for trade, which\u00a0enables\u00a0you to gather\u00a0your food\u00a0supplies quickly. Some survival supplies can be directly purchased in the store.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227110/extras/f0241862d2ee72f96d10f345bec93622.poster.avif?t=1755591807\" width=640 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227110/extras/f0241862d2ee72f96d10f345bec93622.webm?t=1755591807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227110/extras/f0241862d2ee72f96d10f345bec93622.mp4?t=1755591807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227110/extras/eb242e7b6eb81fa2bc7b56bc26d9cb1c.poster.avif?t=1755591807\" width=640 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227110/extras/eb242e7b6eb81fa2bc7b56bc26d9cb1c.webm?t=1755591807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227110/extras/eb242e7b6eb81fa2bc7b56bc26d9cb1c.mp4?t=1755591807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vehicles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can obtain vehicles through scavenging and trading, but it is very difficult for you to own\u00a0a complete vehicle. Usually, they will lack some parts and you have to repair and reassemble them to have a functional vehicle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227110/extras/71ddb660f497132b721e6bb6e3ee1a37.poster.avif?t=1755591807\" width=640 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227110/extras/71ddb660f497132b721e6bb6e3ee1a37.webm?t=1755591807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227110/extras/71ddb660f497132b721e6bb6e3ee1a37.mp4?t=1755591807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227110/extras/9e42b048eee0a19f6415a8ed38249a26.poster.avif?t=1755591807\" width=640 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227110/extras/9e42b048eee0a19f6415a8ed38249a26.webm?t=1755591807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227110/extras/9e42b048eee0a19f6415a8ed38249a26.mp4?t=1755591807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trading</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you can trade in the trading area, using items obtained through scavenging and combat to trade for\u00a0your survival necessities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227110/extras/149b1d3298282d3bf9756d107734e9c0.poster.avif?t=1755591807\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227110/extras/149b1d3298282d3bf9756d107734e9c0.webm?t=1755591807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227110/extras/149b1d3298282d3bf9756d107734e9c0.mp4?t=1755591807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Remain is an MMO game. Within this open world, you can tame &quot;zombies&quot;, making them your labor force, or commanding them to fight your foes. Apart from zombies, you will still have to face the survival challenges of food and water. Remaining warriors, don't let your guard down, and keep surviving...",
